  "question": {
    "html": "<p>Planet <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"X\"></span> and planet <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Y\"></span> both emit radiation as black bodies. Planet <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Y\"></span> has twice the surface temperature and one third of the radius of planet <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"X\"></span>.</p>\n<p>What is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{\\textit{power radiated by planet X}}{\\textit{power radiated by planet Y}}\"></span>?</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{9}{16}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{3}{4}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{4}{3}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{16}{9}\"></span></li></ol>"
